schema_version: 2.0.0
component: TURBULENCE

# Generated from the MAPL2 MAPL_Add*Spec calls in SetServices (develop @ f31a2151),
# in their order.
#
# Not here (hand-written in SetServices): the TRDIFF service (MAPL2's TR
# import), the TRADV subscription, the TRI bundle (export), and the <NAME>IT
# tendency internals for the names in TRI_increments, which are known only at
# run time.
#
# From MAPL2: DEFAULT -> FILL; internals without DEFAULT get FILL 0.0 (MAPL2
# zero-filled internals, MAPL3 does not); MAPL_RestartSkip -> SKIP;
# MAPL_RestartOptional -> blank; FRIENDLYTO (to Turbulence itself, and
# 'DYNAMICS:TURBULENCE' for the SHOC fields) -> ADD2EXPORT (the DYNAMICS part
# is a TRADV subscription in SetServices); UNGRIDDED_DIMS (/NUMUP/) ->
# ungrd_numup; the MAPL2 if blocks -> COND.
#
# ALIAS: TKEDISS is both an export and an internal, and SHFX_SPRAY/LHFX_SPRAY
# both imports and exports; the exports carry the pointer names Run1 uses.

